1
00:01:41,740 --> 00:01:49,030
[Genius Girlfriend]

2
00:01:49,470 --> 00:01:51,900
[Episode 17]

3
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,259
What's wrong, bro? Tired?

4
00:01:57,259 --> 00:01:57,870
Yes.

5
00:01:59,210 --> 00:02:00,140
Let's take a taxi back.

6
00:02:00,140 --> 00:02:01,670
Tired after just this much?

7
00:02:01,980 --> 00:02:03,400
Hey, I have to say,

8
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:05,680
it's really a beautiful sunny day.

9
00:02:07,010 --> 00:02:07,400
Yeah.

10
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,199
So beautiful.

11
00:02:09,750 --> 00:02:11,280
Shen Fuxuan's so annoying,

12
00:02:11,310 --> 00:02:12,750
suddenly uncontactable.

13
00:02:12,750 --> 00:02:14,360
He just ditched us like that.

14
00:02:14,620 --> 00:02:15,800
Right, so disloyal.

15
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:17,520
With all these bags and bundles,
we could really

16
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:19,240
use a pair of strong hands right now.

17
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:20,500
We brought too many snacks.

18
00:02:20,290 --> 00:02:24,690
♪ I'm like the gentle clouds in the sky ♪

19
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:21,960
Let's eat them up quickly.

20
00:02:22,020 --> 00:02:23,190
Don't worry with Duan Qiyan here.

21
00:02:23,190 --> 00:02:24,030
They'll be gone in no time.

22
00:02:24,030 --> 00:02:24,890
Give me a break.

23
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:26,190
What's wrong with you two?

24
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:29,550
♪ Looking forward
to the stop of the night breeze ♪

25
00:02:26,190 --> 00:02:27,960
Not helping the girls

26
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:28,910
carry anything?

27
00:02:30,590 --> 00:02:31,240
Give it to me.

28
00:02:31,160 --> 00:02:37,740
♪ I'm wandering about carefully,
looking for the answer ♪

29
00:02:31,370 --> 00:02:31,860
Thanks.

30
00:02:31,860 --> 00:02:32,590
Give it to me.

31
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:35,150
Layer up when going up the mountain later.

32
00:02:35,150 --> 00:02:36,079
It's cold there.

33
00:02:36,180 --> 00:02:36,590
Okay.

34
00:02:36,780 --> 00:02:37,310
Alright.

35
00:02:41,730 --> 00:02:45,820
♪ Sometimes I wonder
if I should back down ♪

36
00:02:43,710 --> 00:02:44,630
Hurry up!

37
00:02:44,630 --> 00:02:46,000
Hurry, hurry.

38
00:02:47,060 --> 00:02:51,120
♪ Sudden alienation between us
is what scares me the most ♪

39
00:02:52,460 --> 00:02:59,030
♪ How can two hearts beat as one
and truly feel each other? ♪

40
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:07,280
♪ The meteors fly past,
silencing thoughts ♪

41
00:03:09,140 --> 00:03:12,820
♪ Please, give me some clues ♪

42
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:20,579
♪ I hope you can see through
my situation and confusion ♪

43
00:03:21,590 --> 00:03:24,320
♪ And save me ♪

44
00:03:24,690 --> 00:03:29,930
♪ Can you hear me? Why won't you answer? ♪

45
00:03:30,500 --> 00:03:33,840
♪ I'm calling you secretly at night ♪

46
00:03:35,070 --> 00:03:40,400
♪ The moon whispers
fond words by my ears ♪

47
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:46,020
♪ It asks if you're still there
through ups and downs ♪

48
00:03:41,780 --> 00:03:43,360
3, 2, 1.

49
00:03:43,650 --> 00:03:44,400
Turn it on!

50
00:03:46,340 --> 00:03:51,230
♪ Am I lying? I answer my own questions ♪

51
00:03:49,190 --> 00:03:50,150
Nice.

52
00:03:51,770 --> 00:03:56,100
♪ But I've already fallen,
I can't help it, oh ♪

53
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:56,870
Happy graduation!

54
00:03:56,579 --> 00:04:02,780
♪ Forgive me for being silly
for you and only you ♪

55
00:04:02,750 --> 00:04:04,410
The stars are so bright today.

56
00:04:05,010 --> 00:04:11,850
♪ My desires turn into ocean waves
in my dreams, lapping gently ♪

57
00:04:05,430 --> 00:04:07,630
It'll be even more beautiful tomorrow.

58
00:04:07,930 --> 00:04:09,430
This trip of ours

59
00:04:09,870 --> 00:04:13,190
-is totally worth it!
-He's lost it.

60
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:24,630
What's wrong?

61
00:04:28,450 --> 00:04:32,050
I was thinking about how
Shen Fuxuan hasn't contacted us all day.

62
00:04:32,060 --> 00:04:34,390
I'm worried if something happened to him.

63
00:04:34,500 --> 00:04:35,600
Don't worry.

64
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:38,180
He's probably off
having fun by himself.

65
00:04:38,180 --> 00:04:40,270
But why'd he ignore our texts?

66
00:04:41,190 --> 00:04:42,190
Could Shen Fuxuan

67
00:04:42,190 --> 00:04:43,870
have some other reason?

68
00:04:43,930 --> 00:04:45,460
He isn't usually like this.

69
00:04:46,750 --> 00:04:47,560
Actually,

70
00:04:48,270 --> 00:04:49,390
I know the reason.

71
00:04:51,250 --> 00:04:52,650
He contacted me earlier.

72
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:57,190
He gave me a letter

73
00:04:58,930 --> 00:04:59,750
and said

74
00:05:00,370 --> 00:05:02,750
that if we see a meteor shower,

75
00:05:03,430 --> 00:05:05,720
I should read it to everyone for him.

76
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:07,870
What meteor shower?

77
00:05:07,870 --> 00:05:08,830
Just read it now.

78
00:05:10,010 --> 00:05:11,000
Read it now?

79
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,190
Go ahead. It's fine.

80
00:05:20,430 --> 00:05:21,630
Hello,

81
00:05:22,130 --> 00:05:23,060
my dear friends.

82
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:26,510
At this moment,

83
00:05:27,070 --> 00:05:28,800
you must be on the mountain top,

84
00:05:28,980 --> 00:05:30,910
having made wishes while watching

85
00:05:31,190 --> 00:05:32,990
the meteor shower streak across

86
00:05:33,250 --> 00:05:34,380
the vast starry sky.

87
00:05:36,270 --> 00:05:37,270
It's a pity

88
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:39,870
that I couldn't
spend this moment with you,

89
00:05:41,300 --> 00:05:43,030
because I'm currently abroad,

90
00:05:43,430 --> 00:05:45,310
preparing for the new semester

91
00:05:46,500 --> 00:05:48,230
of a five-year medical program

92
00:05:48,690 --> 00:05:49,890
my parents arranged.

93
00:05:51,100 --> 00:05:52,240
He went abroad?

94
00:05:53,890 --> 00:05:56,390
Shen really kept this secret airtight—

95
00:05:56,570 --> 00:05:57,720
not a peep leaked.

96
00:06:01,690 --> 00:06:02,560
I'm sorry for

97
00:06:03,270 --> 00:06:05,270
not telling you this news in person,

98
00:06:05,980 --> 00:06:07,040
because I really didn't know

99
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:08,640
how to say goodbye to you all.

100
00:06:11,770 --> 00:06:13,970
I'm used to being on my own my whole life.

101
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,750
Expressing my feelings

102
00:06:16,230 --> 00:06:17,240
is harder for me

103
00:06:17,750 --> 00:06:19,130
than calculus.

104
00:06:21,630 --> 00:06:24,070
So I can only
write these things down here.

105
00:06:25,860 --> 00:06:28,260
You're the ones
I find hardest to part with.

106
00:06:28,390 --> 00:06:29,450
You're the friends

107
00:06:30,450 --> 00:06:32,060
I'll miss the most.

108
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,400
You probably have no idea

109
00:06:36,450 --> 00:06:37,310
how lucky

110
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,330
someone like me feels

111
00:06:40,500 --> 00:06:41,960
to be treated as one of you.

112
00:06:43,450 --> 00:06:46,240
So, thank you

113
00:06:47,890 --> 00:06:50,010
for letting a buzzkill and loner

114
00:06:50,300 --> 00:06:51,120
like me

115
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:54,180
become a part of your youth.

116
00:06:56,130 --> 00:06:57,530
Being friends with you is

117
00:06:57,830 --> 00:06:59,930
the best thing that's happened to me.

118
00:07:02,330 --> 00:07:03,240
I'm leaving.

119
00:07:04,010 --> 00:07:06,740
Please make a wish
upon a shooting star for me too:

120
00:07:06,750 --> 00:07:08,610
let Shen Fuxuan come back sooner;

121
00:07:09,430 --> 00:07:11,300
don't let him always eat alone;

122
00:07:12,540 --> 00:07:15,920
may our friendship last forever.

123
00:07:27,950 --> 00:07:30,600
Shen really just left like that.

124
00:07:34,220 --> 00:07:35,950
What's with all the long faces?

125
00:07:37,310 --> 00:07:38,720
Communication is so advanced now.

126
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:39,850
Even if he's abroad,

127
00:07:40,100 --> 00:07:41,830
it's very easy to stay in touch.

128
00:07:42,630 --> 00:07:45,270
Exactly. Being far from home is nice too.

129
00:07:45,620 --> 00:07:47,070
Nobody died.

130
00:07:47,570 --> 00:07:48,270
Yeah.

131
00:07:48,870 --> 00:07:51,390
But since we met Shen,

132
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:53,159
we've never really

133
00:07:53,159 --> 00:07:54,830
been apart for a long time.

134
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:57,560
Just thinking about how

135
00:07:57,860 --> 00:08:00,070
we'll be separated soon for a few years

136
00:08:00,750 --> 00:08:02,190
is pretty depressing.

137
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:18,720
Shen Fuxuan is actually
very suited to be a doctor.

138
00:08:19,220 --> 00:08:20,160
He's rigorous,

139
00:08:20,500 --> 00:08:21,480
conscientious,

140
00:08:21,750 --> 00:08:23,750
calm, and has an inquisitive mind.

141
00:08:24,770 --> 00:08:26,310
He will be a great doctor.

142
00:08:29,250 --> 00:08:30,920
So we should be happy for him.

143
00:08:31,390 --> 00:08:32,080
Exactly.

144
00:08:32,860 --> 00:08:33,720
Don't be sad.

145
00:08:35,270 --> 00:08:37,150
Yeah, don't be sad over nothing.

146
00:08:38,820 --> 00:08:39,549
You babies.

147
00:08:39,549 --> 00:08:40,480
This is nothing.

148
00:08:40,980 --> 00:08:43,080
You're just a year older than us.

149
00:08:43,630 --> 00:08:45,150
But I'm a college student,

150
00:08:45,150 --> 00:08:46,680
and you're high schoolers.

151
00:08:47,630 --> 00:08:49,120
Then Mr. College Student,

152
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:51,520
tell us what's so different about college.

153
00:08:55,220 --> 00:08:58,750
Once in college,
you'll find that everything changes.

154
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:01,360
Your horizons will broaden.

155
00:09:02,500 --> 00:09:04,670
And you'll no longer be a kid.

156
00:09:05,500 --> 00:09:07,820
From the moment
you get your acceptance letter,

157
00:09:07,820 --> 00:09:10,200
you'll experience all kinds of goodbyes.

158
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:15,210
For the first time,
you'll part with your family,

159
00:09:15,460 --> 00:09:17,510
with childhood friends,

160
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:20,080
and with your familiar hometown.

161
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:21,720
You'll be in an unfamiliar city,

162
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:23,480
looking at unfamiliar faces.

163
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:24,940
You've to face all of this.

164
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:30,790
Why do we have to grow up?

165
00:09:32,130 --> 00:09:34,390
Why can't we stay together forever?

166
00:09:38,910 --> 00:09:40,670
Growing up is inevitable.

167
00:09:41,510 --> 00:09:42,840
But I think

168
00:09:43,030 --> 00:09:45,160
our friendship can remain unchanged.

169
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:49,130
As long as we hold on,

170
00:09:50,220 --> 00:09:51,680
we can always be together.

171
00:09:55,010 --> 00:09:55,630
Right.

172
00:09:56,630 --> 00:09:58,230
Don't be afraid of goodbyes.

173
00:09:59,410 --> 00:10:00,870
But learn to cherish

174
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:02,550
every present moment.

175
00:10:07,620 --> 00:10:08,720
Makes sense.

176
00:10:09,220 --> 00:10:10,120
But...

177
00:10:13,620 --> 00:10:15,600
Don't you think what he just said

178
00:10:16,390 --> 00:10:18,200
sounds a bit like someone?

179
00:10:18,870 --> 00:10:19,510
Like who?

180
00:10:22,820 --> 00:10:23,720
Um, um...

181
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:25,450
-Director Sui!
-Director Sui!

182
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:27,750
-Yes, I think so too!
-What? No way.

183
00:10:27,750 --> 00:10:29,280
I was just going to say that.

184
00:10:29,510 --> 00:10:31,640
Impossible, absolutely impossible.

185
00:10:32,610 --> 00:10:36,440
To be honest, it is a bit patronizing.

186
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:39,630
Come on, let's toast.

187
00:10:39,630 --> 00:10:40,270
Cheers.

188
00:10:40,890 --> 00:10:41,870
To Shen Fuxuan.

189
00:10:41,890 --> 00:10:43,770
-Shen Fuxuan, you've got this!
-To Shen Fuxuan!

190
00:10:43,770 --> 00:10:44,750
Go for it!

191
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:54,670
Zeqiu,

192
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,600
look how bright that star is.

193
00:10:58,980 --> 00:11:00,510
Which one's the brightest?

194
00:11:00,980 --> 00:11:02,670
I think that one's very bright.

195
00:11:02,670 --> 00:11:03,750
That one's bright too.

196
00:11:03,750 --> 00:11:04,860
That star...

197
00:11:55,270 --> 00:11:56,320
You're awake too.

198
00:12:01,220 --> 00:12:02,150
Do you want to

199
00:12:02,790 --> 00:12:03,670
go for a walk?

200
00:12:14,010 --> 00:12:15,320
Why are you still up?

201
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:17,440
Can't sleep?

202
00:12:19,250 --> 00:12:20,240
Not exactly.

203
00:12:21,030 --> 00:12:22,630
I'm just excited about

204
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:24,380
camping with friends.

205
00:12:24,870 --> 00:12:26,870
What about you? Why can't you sleep?

206
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:28,520
I was drawing comics.

207
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:30,050
Drawing comics?

208
00:12:33,530 --> 00:12:35,630
I'm recording every
important moment of ours

209
00:12:35,630 --> 00:12:37,200
in comics.

210
00:12:38,410 --> 00:12:40,340
I'll show you when I get the chance.

211
00:12:50,390 --> 00:12:51,550
What's that,

212
00:12:52,150 --> 00:12:53,150
that green thing?

213
00:12:53,250 --> 00:12:54,080
Where?

214
00:12:54,290 --> 00:12:55,120
There.

215
00:12:56,750 --> 00:12:57,390
This one?

216
00:13:09,770 --> 00:13:11,030
It's so pretty.

217
00:13:11,910 --> 00:13:13,310
It looks like an emerald.

218
00:13:14,290 --> 00:13:15,480
Any stone in your hands

219
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:16,670
would become a gem.

220
00:13:19,620 --> 00:13:21,790
It must've been polished over time

221
00:13:22,150 --> 00:13:23,750
to have such a perfect shape.

222
00:13:25,870 --> 00:13:26,510
For you.

223
00:13:29,820 --> 00:13:30,750
Why give it to me?

224
00:13:31,370 --> 00:13:32,470
Because I want to.

225
00:13:36,170 --> 00:13:37,270
If you don't want it,

226
00:13:37,270 --> 00:13:38,440
give it back.

227
00:13:38,770 --> 00:13:40,570
I'll ask if anyone else wants it.

228
00:13:40,980 --> 00:13:42,040
Of course I want it.

229
00:13:50,170 --> 00:13:51,700
Are you feeling better now?

230
00:13:56,150 --> 00:13:59,320
I'm just a bit sad
that I didn't get to say goodbye

231
00:13:59,670 --> 00:14:01,070
to Shen Fuxuan in person.

232
00:14:04,720 --> 00:14:05,670
What if

233
00:14:06,530 --> 00:14:08,480
it was Duan Qiyan or someone else

234
00:14:08,650 --> 00:14:09,710
who left this time?

235
00:14:10,460 --> 00:14:11,480
I'd feel the same.

236
00:14:11,650 --> 00:14:13,120
We're all buddies.

237
00:14:15,510 --> 00:14:16,550
What if it was me?

238
00:14:23,290 --> 00:14:24,350
You're different.

239
00:14:27,700 --> 00:14:30,150
Aren't... Aren't we all buddies?

240
00:14:34,200 --> 00:14:36,460
Do you know about the binary star system?

241
00:14:37,080 --> 00:14:38,210
Binary star system?

242
00:14:40,120 --> 00:14:43,870
It means two stars have their own orbits

243
00:14:44,340 --> 00:14:46,390
but revolve around the same center.

244
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:50,700
Duan Qiyan and the rest are my buddies,

245
00:14:50,700 --> 00:14:53,270
but you're more like
my binary star partner.

246
00:14:54,910 --> 00:14:58,000
We'll move forward along different orbits,

247
00:14:59,510 --> 00:15:00,750
but our center will

248
00:15:01,480 --> 00:15:02,540
always be the same.

249
00:15:25,580 --> 00:15:27,980
The binary star system in astrophysics

250
00:15:28,170 --> 00:15:30,860
is a fascinating interstellar system.

251
00:15:32,050 --> 00:15:35,010
Two stars have their own orbits,

252
00:15:35,700 --> 00:15:37,860
revolving around the same center.

253
00:15:38,620 --> 00:15:39,940
They never conflict

254
00:15:40,740 --> 00:15:41,870
and never part ways.

255
00:15:43,170 --> 00:15:45,300
I also have my own binary star partner,

256
00:15:45,870 --> 00:15:48,870
so I'll never be lonely
in the vast universe.

257
00:15:50,620 --> 00:15:53,150
Thank you, my binary star partner,

258
00:15:54,120 --> 00:15:54,910
Jiang Yubai.

259
00:16:23,950 --> 00:16:25,070
What are you looking at,

260
00:16:25,070 --> 00:16:25,960
so absorbed?

261
00:16:28,460 --> 00:16:30,320
Look at these two little flowers.

262
00:16:34,790 --> 00:16:35,630
How special.

263
00:16:39,250 --> 00:16:41,050
On some random day, the two seeds

264
00:16:41,700 --> 00:16:43,700
must've been blown here by the wind.

265
00:16:45,150 --> 00:16:47,120
In this field of pink muhly grass,
they grew together

266
00:16:47,120 --> 00:16:48,080
towards the sun.

267
00:16:49,030 --> 00:16:51,290
This pink muhly field is like a universe.

268
00:16:52,150 --> 00:16:54,670
And these two are lives from afar,

269
00:16:55,410 --> 00:16:57,810
swaying together
in the long river of time.

270
00:16:59,270 --> 00:17:00,600
Don't they look like

271
00:17:00,770 --> 00:17:02,500
a perfect symbiotic function?

272
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:06,329
Mutually dependent

273
00:17:07,530 --> 00:17:10,220
variables with
completely overlapping domains,

274
00:17:10,220 --> 00:17:12,030
where f(x, y) equals zero.

275
00:17:13,460 --> 00:17:16,260
Without either one,
this formula wouldn't exist.

276
00:17:17,770 --> 00:17:20,480
Using a formula to describe two flowers...

277
00:17:22,420 --> 00:17:23,480
is quite novel.

278
00:17:24,510 --> 00:17:26,240
I feel like all relationships

279
00:17:26,240 --> 00:17:28,099
can be expressed with functions.

280
00:17:28,290 --> 00:17:30,620
Friendship is like a composite function:

281
00:17:31,200 --> 00:17:33,160
you need me, and I need you;

282
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:34,720
nested together,

283
00:17:35,110 --> 00:17:37,880
we jointly produce a more interesting

284
00:17:38,250 --> 00:17:39,680
and better range.

285
00:17:41,110 --> 00:17:43,680
A passing encounter
with a stranger is like

286
00:17:44,460 --> 00:17:46,320
a probability density function:

287
00:17:46,880 --> 00:17:49,290
at a certain point in time and space,

288
00:17:49,750 --> 00:17:52,480
the probability of our meeting
is no longer zero,

289
00:17:53,180 --> 00:17:55,040
and then quickly returns to zero.

290
00:18:01,030 --> 00:18:02,000
We...

291
00:18:02,830 --> 00:18:03,920
You two,

292
00:18:04,270 --> 00:18:05,030
stop chatting

293
00:18:05,030 --> 00:18:05,830
and come help!

294
00:18:06,330 --> 00:18:06,730
Hurry!

295
00:18:08,250 --> 00:18:08,780
Let's go.

296
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:11,240
Coming.

297
00:18:17,380 --> 00:18:18,880
Jiang Yubai, come,

298
00:18:19,290 --> 00:18:20,350
help me with the table.

299
00:18:20,350 --> 00:18:21,030
Alright.

300
00:18:24,010 --> 00:18:26,310
Duan Qiyan and I will go
wash the pots and vegetables.

301
00:18:26,310 --> 00:18:27,880
He has too much energy anyway.
Let's go.

302
00:18:27,880 --> 00:18:28,680
Wait, wait.

303
00:18:29,250 --> 00:18:31,010
My delicate hands

304
00:18:31,010 --> 00:18:32,510
can't do that kind of work.

305
00:18:33,570 --> 00:18:35,300
Stop the nonsense and come now.

306
00:18:35,660 --> 00:18:37,030
Fine. Stop pulling me.

307
00:18:38,720 --> 00:18:40,590
Should I bring
the table and tableware over?

308
00:18:40,590 --> 00:18:41,270
Okay.

309
00:18:43,480 --> 00:18:45,750
Hey, bring the cassette stove over.

310
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:46,720
I'll go get it.

311
00:18:47,510 --> 00:18:48,070
Okay.

312
00:18:57,660 --> 00:18:59,110
Why are you so bad at everything?

313
00:18:59,110 --> 00:19:00,870
Can't even wash vegetables properly?

314
00:19:00,870 --> 00:19:02,440
I didn't do it on purpose!

315
00:19:02,960 --> 00:19:04,330
If you think I'm stupid and ridiculous,

316
00:19:04,330 --> 00:19:05,590
then stay away from me!

317
00:19:10,630 --> 00:19:13,490
What's with that girl?
What did I do to deserve this?

318
00:19:14,790 --> 00:19:16,680
Attention, everyone.

319
00:19:17,270 --> 00:19:18,920
I think we can play a game.

320
00:19:19,010 --> 00:19:20,680
Only the winners of this game

321
00:19:21,180 --> 00:19:22,960
get to eat. How about it?

322
00:19:22,960 --> 00:19:23,750
What game?

323
00:19:23,810 --> 00:19:24,960
This game's very simple.

324
00:19:24,960 --> 00:19:26,290
I'll explain the rules.

325
00:19:26,510 --> 00:19:28,110
First, we'll close our eyes.

326
00:19:28,310 --> 00:19:30,000
I'll count down from 3,
and then we'll all

327
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:31,640
open our eyes at the same time.

328
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:33,100
If two people's eyes meet,

329
00:19:33,250 --> 00:19:36,310
they'll be the winners
of the round of the game.

330
00:19:36,330 --> 00:19:37,110
Of course,

331
00:19:37,400 --> 00:19:38,590
if a third person

332
00:19:38,590 --> 00:19:39,830
makes eye contact with

333
00:19:39,830 --> 00:19:41,270
either of you two,

334
00:19:41,660 --> 00:19:42,920
it won't count as a win.

335
00:19:43,510 --> 00:19:45,030
Alright, got it? It's very simple.

336
00:19:45,030 --> 00:19:45,880
You'd be a fool to not get it.

337
00:19:45,880 --> 00:19:46,720
Come on.

338
00:19:47,250 --> 00:19:48,780
Everyone, close your eyes.

339
00:19:49,550 --> 00:19:50,680
Okay, I got it.

340
00:19:50,680 --> 00:19:52,240
Yeah? Close your eyes.

341
00:19:52,400 --> 00:19:53,070
Right.

342
00:19:53,220 --> 00:19:54,550
Close your eyes. Good.

343
00:19:54,750 --> 00:19:56,480
3, 2, 1.

344
00:19:56,940 --> 00:19:57,800
Open your eyes!

345
00:20:02,090 --> 00:20:03,000
Wait.

346
00:20:04,110 --> 00:20:05,480
I looked at her.

347
00:20:05,480 --> 00:20:07,180
Right. Jiang looked at you, Zhixia.

348
00:20:07,180 --> 00:20:08,160
Again.

349
00:20:08,160 --> 00:20:09,510
T-This doesn't count as a win.

350
00:20:09,510 --> 00:20:10,960
Come on, again.

351
00:20:11,110 --> 00:20:12,110
Close your eyes.

352
00:20:12,570 --> 00:20:14,590
3, 2, 1.

353
00:20:14,920 --> 00:20:15,780
Open your eyes!

354
00:20:22,640 --> 00:20:23,310
Your eyes met?

355
00:20:23,310 --> 00:20:24,260
Yes, the two of us.

356
00:20:24,260 --> 00:20:25,960
Who did you look at?
You didn't look at them, right?

357
00:20:25,960 --> 00:20:26,510
Right, she didn't.

358
00:20:26,510 --> 00:20:27,240
Okay, you two won.

359
00:20:27,240 --> 00:20:27,920
You can eat!

360
00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:29,550
If we didn't see it,
that means we made eye contact.

361
00:20:29,550 --> 00:20:30,830
Yes. Go on, eat up.

362
00:20:31,700 --> 00:20:34,300
-They won. Let's continue.
-It smells so good!

363
00:20:35,050 --> 00:20:36,070
I'm so hungry.

364
00:20:36,290 --> 00:20:37,880
No use in complaining. Ignore them.

365
00:20:37,880 --> 00:20:38,880
We need to eat too.

366
00:20:39,240 --> 00:20:40,170
Close your eyes!

367
00:20:40,350 --> 00:20:41,480
3, 2, 1.

368
00:20:41,770 --> 00:20:42,630
Open your eyes!

369
00:20:44,290 --> 00:20:45,240
Our eyes met.

370
00:20:45,310 --> 00:20:46,640
I looked at Lin Zeqiu.

371
00:20:49,330 --> 00:20:50,830
Stop looking at him. What's there to see?

372
00:20:50,830 --> 00:20:52,400
You ruined our chance to eat!

373
00:20:52,400 --> 00:20:53,070
Again!

374
00:20:53,460 --> 00:20:55,030
Eat slowly. Leave some food for us.

375
00:20:55,030 --> 00:20:55,640
Come on.

376
00:20:55,640 --> 00:20:56,240
Come on.

377
00:20:56,290 --> 00:20:57,070
Close your eyes.

378
00:20:57,070 --> 00:20:58,070
3, 2, 1.

379
00:20:58,220 --> 00:20:58,830
Let's go!

380
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:04,000
Yummy, right?

381
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:04,590
Yummy.

382
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:06,900
You looked at me, huh?

383
00:21:06,900 --> 00:21:07,790
Last round.

384
00:21:07,790 --> 00:21:08,550
I'm at my limit.

385
00:21:08,550 --> 00:21:10,480
-No, there must be winners.
-It's delicious.

386
00:21:10,480 --> 00:21:11,790
This game has no end.

387
00:21:11,790 --> 00:21:13,240
It has, for sure.

388
00:21:13,350 --> 00:21:14,750
Come on, close your eyes.

389
00:21:14,880 --> 00:21:15,960
3, 2, 1.

390
00:21:15,960 --> 00:21:16,820
Open your eyes!

391
00:21:19,570 --> 00:21:21,310
You two look at each other. Let's eat.

392
00:21:21,310 --> 00:21:22,030
Don't mind them.

393
00:21:22,030 --> 00:21:22,960
You two keep looking.

394
00:21:22,960 --> 00:21:23,880
I'll have one.

395
00:21:23,880 --> 00:21:25,030
Who wants some Coke?

396
00:21:25,030 --> 00:21:26,480
-Me, me!
-Me too.

397
00:21:26,500 --> 00:21:27,200
Slow down.

398
00:21:27,200 --> 00:21:28,460
Here, have a fishball.

399
00:21:29,720 --> 00:21:30,480
Thanks.

400
00:21:36,980 --> 00:21:39,400
Zeqiu... it's overflowing.

401
00:21:49,380 --> 00:21:50,590
Zeqiu, have one too.

402
00:21:51,850 --> 00:21:52,750
Delicious.

403
00:21:55,480 --> 00:21:56,200
Delicious.

404
00:21:56,200 --> 00:21:56,790
Then...

405
00:21:58,140 --> 00:22:00,070
g-give me one too.

406
00:22:02,180 --> 00:22:04,310
This fishball's r-really delicious.

407
00:22:05,380 --> 00:22:06,640
It has fish roe inside.

408
00:22:07,200 --> 00:22:08,000
Is it good?

409
00:22:08,000 --> 00:22:09,880
It's good. Try it while it's hot.

410
00:22:10,590 --> 00:22:11,310
Here.

411
00:22:11,900 --> 00:22:12,590
Thanks.

412
00:22:12,980 --> 00:22:14,640
-It's delicious.
-Thank you.

413
00:22:16,270 --> 00:22:17,270
It's nothing special.

414
00:22:17,270 --> 00:22:18,270
Give it to me then.

415
00:22:22,700 --> 00:22:23,440
It's so good.

416
00:22:26,810 --> 00:22:29,270
-Look at my jellyfish.
-Eat your jellyfish.

417
00:22:31,270 --> 00:22:34,480
This jellyfish took me a lot of effort.

418
00:22:36,960 --> 00:22:38,090
What are you doing?

419
00:22:38,090 --> 00:22:39,420
Tingting, are you full?

420
00:22:45,500 --> 00:22:46,760
Are you on a diet again?

421
00:22:47,380 --> 00:22:49,680
You've been dieting every day this year,

422
00:22:49,680 --> 00:22:51,160
but you're still the same.

423
00:22:52,090 --> 00:22:54,220
I'm not going to see the meteor shower.

424
00:22:55,900 --> 00:22:57,100
You all go without me.

425
00:23:03,290 --> 00:23:04,480
W-Wait, Tang,

426
00:23:04,640 --> 00:23:06,110
I was just joking.

427
00:23:06,500 --> 00:23:08,110
What I meant is

428
00:23:08,510 --> 00:23:10,590
your figure's already perfect.

429
00:23:10,590 --> 00:23:11,480
You're so thin.

430
00:23:11,480 --> 00:23:12,510
Why diet?

431
00:23:12,510 --> 00:23:13,960
You have no weight to lose.

432
00:23:13,960 --> 00:23:14,760
You're great.

433
00:23:14,880 --> 00:23:15,940
You're excellent.

434
00:23:16,050 --> 00:23:17,850
Duan Qiyan, shut up for a moment.

435
00:23:24,050 --> 00:23:24,920
What's wrong?

436
00:23:27,090 --> 00:23:28,030
Nothing.

437
00:23:28,380 --> 00:23:30,110
I just don't want to go anymore.

438
00:23:33,720 --> 00:23:35,780
Tingting, is something on your mind?

439
00:23:40,680 --> 00:23:42,200
I don't want to make a wish.

440
00:23:43,420 --> 00:23:44,590
Even if I make one,

441
00:23:44,900 --> 00:23:46,030
it won't come true.

442
00:23:47,180 --> 00:23:48,440
Why won't it come true?

443
00:23:49,680 --> 00:23:51,090
I want to go to Qingbei University,

444
00:23:51,090 --> 00:23:52,490
but I know I won't make it.

445
00:23:52,810 --> 00:23:54,550
So my wish won't come true.

446
00:23:55,200 --> 00:23:57,310
What if it affects your wishes too?

447
00:23:57,610 --> 00:23:59,210
I don't want to drag you down.

448
00:24:02,140 --> 00:24:04,270
What are you laughing at? I'm serious!

449
00:24:04,510 --> 00:24:06,370
I don't want to bring you bad luck.

450
00:24:09,090 --> 00:24:10,400
That's such a wild thought.

451
00:24:10,400 --> 00:24:11,660
Don't think like that.

452
00:24:14,070 --> 00:24:16,000
Tang, let me help you out with that.

453
00:24:16,580 --> 00:24:17,570
How about this?

454
00:24:17,570 --> 00:24:19,480
Don't wish for Qingbei.

455
00:24:19,640 --> 00:24:21,160
Wish for Zhendan.

456
00:24:22,240 --> 00:24:23,830
It's not like Qingbei is the only

457
00:24:23,830 --> 00:24:25,230
university in the world.

458
00:24:25,720 --> 00:24:27,110
Just wish for Zhendan.

459
00:24:27,310 --> 00:24:28,310
It will come true.

460
00:24:36,480 --> 00:24:39,310
Then when you all get into Qingbei,

461
00:24:39,310 --> 00:24:41,040
I'll be the only one at Zhendan.

462
00:24:42,220 --> 00:24:43,640
I'll drift further and further
away from you,

463
00:24:43,640 --> 00:24:45,300
and our friendship will fade.

464
00:24:45,420 --> 00:24:46,750
What if in the future,

465
00:24:47,110 --> 00:24:49,000
we completely lose touch?

466
00:24:51,880 --> 00:24:52,680
We won't.

467
00:24:54,590 --> 00:24:55,720
Didn't you say that

468
00:24:57,510 --> 00:24:59,680
we're friends filtered over time?

469
00:25:01,310 --> 00:25:02,350
You need us,

470
00:25:02,880 --> 00:25:03,940
and we need you too.

471
00:25:07,090 --> 00:25:09,110
Because of you,
we started listening to music,

472
00:25:09,110 --> 00:25:10,270
going to concerts,

473
00:25:10,570 --> 00:25:12,240
and doing lots of fun things.

474
00:25:12,920 --> 00:25:13,550
Yeah.

475
00:25:14,070 --> 00:25:16,330
We even did a performance because of you.

476
00:25:17,680 --> 00:25:19,880
These are wonderful memories we share.

477
00:25:19,900 --> 00:25:22,760
We won't drift apart
because of physical distance.

478
00:25:29,180 --> 00:25:29,880
Tang,

479
00:25:30,590 --> 00:25:31,450
think about it.

480
00:25:31,510 --> 00:25:33,510
We grew up together.

481
00:25:33,770 --> 00:25:35,170
Will our friendship fade

482
00:25:35,220 --> 00:25:36,880
just because we're apart

483
00:25:37,110 --> 00:25:38,510
for a mere four years?

484
00:25:40,350 --> 00:25:41,640
You're underestimating

485
00:25:41,640 --> 00:25:42,830
our friendship.

486
00:25:46,510 --> 00:25:47,940
We've been partners in crime

487
00:25:47,940 --> 00:25:49,460
since we were little.

488
00:25:49,850 --> 00:25:52,250
Once you graduate and come to Huacheng,

489
00:25:52,380 --> 00:25:54,380
I'll take you out to turn the place

490
00:25:54,380 --> 00:25:55,420
upside down.

491
00:25:56,510 --> 00:25:57,910
Who's your partner in crime?

492
00:25:57,910 --> 00:25:58,660
Get lost.

493
00:25:59,030 --> 00:25:59,810
Okay.

494
00:26:03,340 --> 00:26:04,750
He rolled into our tent.

495
00:26:05,420 --> 00:26:06,530
Rolled into the wrong place.

496
00:26:06,530 --> 00:26:07,920
Roll back here.

497
00:26:08,240 --> 00:26:09,100
Roll back here.

498
00:26:09,460 --> 00:26:10,520
I'm a little dizzy.

499
00:26:11,310 --> 00:26:12,270
Show-off.

500
00:26:13,940 --> 00:26:14,680
-Let's eat.
-Come on.

501
00:26:14,680 --> 00:26:15,830
Let's have a drink.

502
00:26:16,010 --> 00:26:17,000
To friendship.

503
00:26:17,140 --> 00:26:17,920
Come on.

504
00:26:17,950 --> 00:26:18,680
-Come on.
-Cheers!

505
00:26:18,680 --> 00:26:19,560
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

506
00:26:19,560 --> 00:26:20,470
Cheers!

507
00:26:20,490 --> 00:26:21,960
Cheers!

508
00:26:37,380 --> 00:26:38,040
I'm coming!

509
00:26:38,720 --> 00:26:39,580
Oh my goodness.

510
00:26:39,830 --> 00:26:40,720
I bounced up.

511
00:26:41,900 --> 00:26:43,900
Are you just bad at this or faking it?

512
00:26:47,960 --> 00:26:50,020
Why aren't you hanging out with them?

513
00:26:50,590 --> 00:26:52,030
Let me! I'll help you.

514
00:26:52,160 --> 00:26:53,360
They're so childish.

515
00:26:55,140 --> 00:26:56,160
Childish?

516
00:26:57,070 --> 00:26:58,400
Coming from you?

517
00:26:59,000 --> 00:27:00,600
Aren't you in the same class?

518
00:27:02,110 --> 00:27:04,310
Did you forget we're the same age?

519
00:27:06,350 --> 00:27:08,400
Right, we're the same age.

520
00:27:08,700 --> 00:27:09,310
I forgot.

521
00:27:12,180 --> 00:27:13,310
Look who's talking.

522
00:27:14,140 --> 00:27:15,030
You're just

523
00:27:15,030 --> 00:27:16,590
a year older than your sister.

524
00:27:16,590 --> 00:27:17,440
So worried about

525
00:27:17,440 --> 00:27:18,790
your sister coming out to play that

526
00:27:18,790 --> 00:27:19,920
you had to tag along?

527
00:27:21,270 --> 00:27:23,110
It's not that I don't trust her.

528
00:27:25,590 --> 00:27:26,920
Stand there in one spot.

529
00:27:26,940 --> 00:27:28,310
It's just that hanging out with you all

530
00:27:28,310 --> 00:27:29,480
is actually pretty fun.

531
00:27:29,480 --> 00:27:29,980
Start.

532
00:27:31,070 --> 00:27:33,200
Even though sometimes I don't join in,

533
00:27:34,590 --> 00:27:37,390
it's still pretty fun
just watching from the side.

534
00:27:53,880 --> 00:27:55,830
Actually, all my life,

535
00:27:55,830 --> 00:27:58,490
I've rarely participated
in group activities.

536
00:28:00,510 --> 00:28:01,590
But now I feel that

537
00:28:01,850 --> 00:28:03,310
as long as I stay with them,

538
00:28:03,730 --> 00:28:04,860
I'm very satisfied.

539
00:28:15,530 --> 00:28:16,480
Stop playing!

540
00:28:18,090 --> 00:28:19,030
Stop playing!

541
00:28:19,440 --> 00:28:20,500
Come back and help!

542
00:28:20,740 --> 00:28:21,720
Come down!

543
00:28:21,720 --> 00:28:23,200
Coming! Let's go.

544
00:28:32,240 --> 00:28:33,940
It's 9 PM. The meteor shower's coming.

545
00:28:33,940 --> 00:28:34,880
Let's guess who

546
00:28:35,200 --> 00:28:37,130
will spot the first shooting star.

547
00:28:37,290 --> 00:28:38,000
I predict

548
00:28:38,310 --> 00:28:40,550
I'll be the first to catch one.

549
00:28:41,090 --> 00:28:43,830
Stop guessing.
You suck but still love to compete.

550
00:28:43,830 --> 00:28:45,350
With your short attention span,

551
00:28:45,350 --> 00:28:46,810
you think you'll be first?

552
00:28:55,830 --> 00:28:56,790
Is that one?

553
00:28:58,330 --> 00:28:59,480
That's an airplane.

554
00:29:05,140 --> 00:29:06,030
Is that it?

555
00:29:06,450 --> 00:29:08,440
That's over the sea, Duan Qiyan.

556
00:29:08,580 --> 00:29:09,660
That's a lighthouse.

557
00:29:09,660 --> 00:29:11,720
Shooting stars don't look like that.

558
00:29:18,200 --> 00:29:19,010
What about that?

559
00:29:19,010 --> 00:29:20,350
That's a flying spark.

560
00:29:23,150 --> 00:29:25,180
Give it a rest.

561
00:29:26,120 --> 00:29:27,770
You almost set me on fire.

562
00:29:30,000 --> 00:29:31,640
Zeqiu, there hasn't been a shooting star.

563
00:29:31,640 --> 00:29:32,640
Are you stressed?

564
00:29:32,960 --> 00:29:34,720
I'm not stressed.

565
00:29:34,810 --> 00:29:37,590
You have to trust
your brother's professionalism.

566
00:29:37,590 --> 00:29:39,960
Besides, even weather forecasts
are wrong sometimes.

567
00:29:39,960 --> 00:29:41,890
Don't be anxious. Give it a minute.

568
00:29:47,330 --> 00:29:49,750
I remember when we watched them
at the astronomy club,

569
00:29:49,750 --> 00:29:52,650
there were usually
only one or two at first.

570
00:29:54,010 --> 00:29:55,400
But then they became meteor showers.

571
00:29:55,400 --> 00:29:56,380
Really stunning.

572
00:29:56,380 --> 00:29:57,240
Yeah.

573
00:29:57,720 --> 00:29:58,880
It hasn't reached

574
00:29:58,880 --> 00:30:01,000
the peak of the meteor shower yet.

575
00:30:01,330 --> 00:30:02,740
Waiting for a shooting star,

576
00:30:02,740 --> 00:30:04,000
you have to be sincere.

577
00:30:04,290 --> 00:30:06,890
Be truly sincere
from the bottom of your heart.

578
00:30:11,250 --> 00:30:12,440
Should we tell

579
00:30:12,440 --> 00:30:13,880
the shooting stars our wishes

580
00:30:13,880 --> 00:30:14,960
to summon them?

581
00:30:14,960 --> 00:30:16,720
I'll go first. I have one in mind.

582
00:30:16,720 --> 00:30:18,200
Lord Shooting Star!

583
00:30:18,660 --> 00:30:20,120
I want to get into Zhendan!

584
00:30:20,350 --> 00:30:22,680
I also want to become super pretty.

585
00:30:22,850 --> 00:30:24,480
And super rich.

586
00:30:25,160 --> 00:30:27,610
It'd be best if I could also
become Han Geng's manager.

587
00:30:27,610 --> 00:30:29,350
And I want to travel around the world!

588
00:30:29,350 --> 00:30:30,350
Hold it, hold it.

589
00:30:30,640 --> 00:30:33,020
Your self-introduction
is so long-winded, Tang.

590
00:30:33,020 --> 00:30:34,880
By then, your self-introduction

591
00:30:35,030 --> 00:30:37,110
will be famous Zhendan alumnus,

592
00:30:37,130 --> 00:30:39,130
beautiful, rich woman,

593
00:30:39,160 --> 00:30:42,270
and Han Geng's manager—Tang Tingting.

594
00:30:42,290 --> 00:30:44,150
Wait, there's an addendum:

595
00:30:44,450 --> 00:30:46,150
traveling around the world.

596
00:30:47,290 --> 00:30:48,510
Duan Qiyan,

597
00:30:48,980 --> 00:30:50,570
the shooting stars are watching.

598
00:30:50,570 --> 00:30:52,880
You'd better watch your mouth,

599
00:30:52,900 --> 00:30:54,300
or it might not bless you.

600
00:30:57,030 --> 00:30:58,620
Look at my big mouth.

601
00:30:58,980 --> 00:31:00,480
Um, Lord Shooting Star,

602
00:31:00,640 --> 00:31:03,340
I was just joking!

603
00:31:03,360 --> 00:31:06,160
Just showing off a bit of my own humor.

604
00:31:06,850 --> 00:31:07,680
Um,

605
00:31:07,700 --> 00:31:08,830
don't mind me.

606
00:31:12,200 --> 00:31:12,880
Hey,

607
00:31:12,960 --> 00:31:13,790
Zeqiu.

608
00:31:14,590 --> 00:31:15,480
Tell us

609
00:31:15,590 --> 00:31:17,160
how many shooting stars you can catch

610
00:31:17,160 --> 00:31:18,790
and what wishes you'll make.

611
00:31:18,790 --> 00:31:20,000
Catch shooting stars?

612
00:31:20,000 --> 00:31:20,960
Am I a cop?

613
00:31:24,590 --> 00:31:25,450
Shooting Star,

614
00:31:26,660 --> 00:31:27,880
I want to always

615
00:31:28,590 --> 00:31:30,650
be able to see the person I want to see.

616
00:31:32,650 --> 00:31:33,350
Who's that?

617
00:31:33,350 --> 00:31:34,310
Who's that?

618
00:31:35,290 --> 00:31:37,310
There are many people I want to see.

619
00:31:38,180 --> 00:31:39,160
Jin Baihui.

620
00:31:39,770 --> 00:31:40,830
What's your wish?

621
00:31:42,050 --> 00:31:42,960
I...

622
00:31:46,460 --> 00:31:47,960
Hello, Shooting Star!

623
00:31:48,570 --> 00:31:50,700
I want to be a little further from home!

624
00:31:58,200 --> 00:31:59,460
What's with that look?

625
00:32:00,250 --> 00:32:01,880
Isn't it good to be further from home?

626
00:32:01,880 --> 00:32:03,480
That way I can be with you all.

627
00:32:05,510 --> 00:32:07,080
I got into Qingbei.

628
00:32:07,110 --> 00:32:10,510
Surely my parents won't pressure me
to study anymore, right?

629
00:32:11,680 --> 00:32:12,480
That's right.

630
00:32:18,180 --> 00:32:19,000
Jiang Yubai,

631
00:32:19,200 --> 00:32:22,460
your shooting star can't hear you
if you just whisper to it.

632
00:32:28,700 --> 00:32:31,500
I want to go to Qingbei University
with Lin Zhixia.

633
00:32:40,050 --> 00:32:41,440
I'm not done yet, Zeqiu.

634
00:32:41,660 --> 00:32:45,120
I want to stargaze with Zeqiu.

635
00:32:45,410 --> 00:32:47,610
I also want to play ball with Duan Qiyan.

636
00:32:47,980 --> 00:32:50,240
I want to hit the library with Jin Baihui.

637
00:32:50,850 --> 00:32:52,110
And share life stories

638
00:32:52,310 --> 00:32:53,370
with Tang Tingting

639
00:32:53,660 --> 00:32:55,160
and Shen Fuxuan.

640
00:32:58,560 --> 00:33:01,830
Your wishes sound
so heartwarming and lovely.

641
00:33:05,790 --> 00:33:07,160
Maybe everyone thinks

642
00:33:07,900 --> 00:33:09,160
I have a lot of friends.

643
00:33:10,660 --> 00:33:11,720
But actually,

644
00:33:13,070 --> 00:33:17,130
I've been constantly transferring schools
and changing environments,

645
00:33:17,900 --> 00:33:21,360
often parting ways right after
getting to know my classmates.

646
00:33:21,500 --> 00:33:23,590
I haven't had any deep friendships.

647
00:33:26,700 --> 00:33:27,480
So,

648
00:33:28,380 --> 00:33:30,180
I'm very glad to have met you all.

649
00:33:33,700 --> 00:33:35,920
Zeqiu and I had a rough start.

650
00:33:36,660 --> 00:33:39,310
At that time, I thought
he was bullying Lin Zhixia.

651
00:33:39,310 --> 00:33:41,370
I didn't expect him to be her brother.

652
00:33:44,310 --> 00:33:45,640
Duan Qiyan, Jin Baihui.

653
00:33:45,880 --> 00:33:48,050
If it weren't for
the competition prep with you,

654
00:33:48,050 --> 00:33:49,850
I'd never have fought to the end.

655
00:33:52,050 --> 00:33:54,350
Tang Tingting, if it weren't for you,

656
00:33:54,810 --> 00:33:58,610
I really wouldn't have had the chance
to help the police solve a case.

657
00:34:01,390 --> 00:34:03,850
And to Shen Fuxuan,
who's far away overseas:

658
00:34:04,380 --> 00:34:05,580
if it weren't for you,

659
00:34:06,460 --> 00:34:07,960
I wouldn't have known that so many people

660
00:34:07,960 --> 00:34:09,489
would have my back that day.

661
00:34:12,860 --> 00:34:14,920
The most important one is Lin Zhixia.

662
00:34:17,570 --> 00:34:18,480
We went through

663
00:34:19,150 --> 00:34:21,480
many important moments in life together.

664
00:34:24,630 --> 00:34:26,090
Maybe even you don't know,

665
00:34:26,760 --> 00:34:28,159
but it's because I met you

666
00:34:28,500 --> 00:34:29,830
that I could have so many

667
00:34:30,170 --> 00:34:32,250
wonderful stories and beautiful bonds

668
00:34:32,250 --> 00:34:33,510
with everyone.

669
00:34:35,210 --> 00:34:36,469
And because of you all,

670
00:34:38,170 --> 00:34:40,550
my night sky has become even brighter.

671
00:34:41,380 --> 00:34:42,150
So...

672
00:34:49,730 --> 00:34:50,920
What are those?

673
00:34:53,150 --> 00:34:54,190
I made these yesterday

674
00:34:54,190 --> 00:34:56,250
using petals from the sea of flowers.

675
00:34:56,360 --> 00:34:58,840
In case we don't see
a shooting star today,

676
00:34:59,150 --> 00:35:00,610
it can serve as a keepsake.

677
00:35:00,940 --> 00:35:02,870
This way, when everyone sees this,

678
00:35:02,980 --> 00:35:05,580
it'll feel as if
we're right next to each other.

679
00:35:07,490 --> 00:35:08,550
And each bottle contains

680
00:35:08,550 --> 00:35:09,650
a different flower,

681
00:35:09,650 --> 00:35:10,960
each conveying a different meaning.

682
00:35:10,960 --> 00:35:11,920
I won't elaborate.

683
00:35:11,920 --> 00:35:13,720
Look it up yourselves when you go back.

684
00:35:13,720 --> 00:35:14,500
Here.

685
00:35:16,500 --> 00:35:17,390
Yours, Duan Qiyan.

686
00:35:17,390 --> 00:35:18,230
Thanks.

687
00:35:18,400 --> 00:35:20,400
-Tang Tingting, yours.
-Thank you.

688
00:35:21,670 --> 00:35:22,510
Jin Baihui, yours.

689
00:35:22,510 --> 00:35:23,280
Thank you.

690
00:35:27,760 --> 00:35:28,480
Zeqiu.

691
00:35:31,360 --> 00:35:32,190
This is yours.

692
00:35:37,760 --> 00:35:39,000
So pretty.

693
00:35:39,050 --> 00:35:40,020
What's yours?

694
00:35:40,050 --> 00:35:41,400
It even has my name.

695
00:35:45,940 --> 00:35:46,740
Maple leaves?

696
00:35:47,650 --> 00:35:49,980
-Pink flowers.
-What's yours? Let me see.

697
00:35:51,940 --> 00:35:53,470
It's already 9:30 PM.

698
00:35:53,740 --> 00:35:55,670
About time a shooting star appear.

699
00:35:57,000 --> 00:35:57,730
I don't know.

700
00:35:58,590 --> 00:36:00,440
Will we get to see one tonight?

701
00:36:01,960 --> 00:36:02,590
It's okay.

702
00:36:02,760 --> 00:36:04,510
Why don't we play something,

703
00:36:04,510 --> 00:36:05,190
or...

704
00:36:06,550 --> 00:36:07,800
does anyone have snacks?

705
00:36:07,800 --> 00:36:08,670
I'm hungry.

706
00:36:08,670 --> 00:36:09,760
I have some food here.

707
00:36:09,760 --> 00:36:10,400
I have some.

708
00:36:10,400 --> 00:36:12,130
There are snacks here. Come on.

709
00:36:12,690 --> 00:36:14,030
I'll add some firewood!

710
00:36:17,000 --> 00:36:18,380
Maybe after today,

711
00:36:19,110 --> 00:36:21,130
we'll never be in the same city anymore.

712
00:36:19,810 --> 00:36:25,480
♪ Only for this lingering warmth
of the moment ♪

713
00:36:22,400 --> 00:36:24,730
We might not see each other
for a long time.

714
00:36:26,030 --> 00:36:28,190
Everyone traveled a long, long way

715
00:36:26,920 --> 00:36:32,710
♪ Trading souls with the night ♪

716
00:36:29,030 --> 00:36:30,630
just to make a wish upon you.

717
00:36:31,920 --> 00:36:34,360
Please don't leave everyone with regrets.

718
00:36:33,890 --> 00:36:39,430
♪ Every dusk I have stolen ♪

719
00:36:37,590 --> 00:36:39,780
Please, you must appear.

720
00:36:40,860 --> 00:36:46,670
♪ Foretells a parting ♪

721
00:36:41,630 --> 00:36:42,550
Please.

722
00:36:43,690 --> 00:36:44,320
This one!

723
00:36:44,320 --> 00:36:45,320
It's super yummy.

724
00:36:45,690 --> 00:36:46,440
Let me see.

725
00:36:46,800 --> 00:36:48,330
Why's there so little left?

726
00:36:49,160 --> 00:36:55,460
♪ Where did the storm start brewing ♪

727
00:36:50,960 --> 00:36:51,840
What's that?

728
00:36:53,460 --> 00:36:54,550
-A shooting star!
-A shooting star!

729
00:36:54,550 --> 00:36:55,880
Shooting stars! Hurry!

730
00:36:55,880 --> 00:36:57,550
-Hurry! Hurry!
-Shooting stars!

731
00:36:56,070 --> 00:37:01,660
♪ Drenching you before we knew it? ♪

732
00:36:57,800 --> 00:36:58,730
Shooting stars!

733
00:36:59,050 --> 00:37:00,190
Hurry, hurry!

734
00:37:00,190 --> 00:37:00,840
Shooting stars! Shooting stars!

735
00:37:00,840 --> 00:37:01,670
Hurry, hurry!

736
00:37:01,670 --> 00:37:02,550
Shooting stars!

737
00:37:02,460 --> 00:37:05,300
♪ Let me draw near to you ♪

738
00:37:02,940 --> 00:37:04,190
They're so beautiful.

739
00:37:04,190 --> 00:37:05,050
So pretty.

740
00:37:06,030 --> 00:37:08,950
♪ Let me imagine you ♪

741
00:37:09,460 --> 00:37:11,700
♪ Let me sink into your ♪

742
00:37:12,110 --> 00:37:15,770
♪ Scattered golden glow ♪

743
00:37:16,580 --> 00:37:19,070
♪ Let the night blur your figure ♪

744
00:37:17,500 --> 00:37:18,560
Right, make a wish!

745
00:37:18,630 --> 00:37:19,710
Make a wish now!

746
00:37:19,890 --> 00:37:22,660
♪ Yet tear myself away from you ♪

747
00:37:20,150 --> 00:37:21,780
Make one for Shen Fuxuan first.

748
00:37:21,780 --> 00:37:23,110
May our friendship

749
00:37:23,300 --> 00:37:25,360
-last forever!
-Last forever!

750
00:37:23,390 --> 00:37:25,950
♪ I can't fathom why ♪

751
00:37:25,710 --> 00:37:26,880
One more, hurry!

752
00:37:26,580 --> 00:37:29,890
♪ I've never truly possessed you ♪

753
00:37:27,460 --> 00:37:28,120
Make a wish.

754
00:37:30,500 --> 00:37:32,150
Huacheng, here I come!

755
00:37:30,810 --> 00:37:33,750
♪ That blazing, radiant feeling ♪

756
00:37:32,360 --> 00:37:35,550
When I get there, I will make my mark!

757
00:37:34,350 --> 00:37:37,000
♪ Once the rain stops, clouds disperse ♪

758
00:37:36,090 --> 00:37:37,400
There's no time.
Everyone make your own wish.

759
00:37:37,400 --> 00:37:38,400
Hurry!

760
00:37:37,640 --> 00:37:43,530
♪ Hence, time and again, I lose ♪

761
00:37:41,530 --> 00:37:43,820
I want to take good care
of the people around me,

762
00:37:43,820 --> 00:37:46,150
especially my parents
and my little sister.

763
00:37:44,030 --> 00:37:44,930
♪ Myself ♪

764
00:37:45,190 --> 00:37:47,030
♪ Draw near to you ♪

765
00:37:47,510 --> 00:37:50,320
♪ Let me imagine you ♪

766
00:37:48,980 --> 00:37:50,590
Oh heavens, all gods and immortals,

767
00:37:50,590 --> 00:37:52,610
please bless me so I don't fall behind.

768
00:37:50,890 --> 00:37:53,240
♪ Let me sink into your ♪

769
00:37:53,570 --> 00:37:57,210
♪ Scattered golden glow ♪

770
00:37:57,860 --> 00:38:01,030
I hope I can truly be myself one day.

771
00:37:58,010 --> 00:38:00,550
♪ Let the night blur your figure ♪

772
00:38:01,360 --> 00:38:04,090
♪ Yet tear myself away from you ♪

773
00:38:04,780 --> 00:38:07,370
♪ I can't fathom why ♪

774
00:38:05,590 --> 00:38:08,340
I, Duan Qiyan,
must make my mark in Huacheng.

775
00:38:07,950 --> 00:38:11,150
♪ I've never truly possessed you ♪

776
00:38:09,860 --> 00:38:11,120
I hope there comes a day

777
00:38:11,460 --> 00:38:12,780
when Lin Zhixia understands...

778
00:38:12,230 --> 00:38:15,210
♪ That blazing, radiant feeling ♪

779
00:38:15,800 --> 00:38:18,440
♪ Once the rain stops, clouds disperse ♪

780
00:38:19,090 --> 00:38:26,250
♪ The rarest blessing in life
is a sweet dream ♪

781
00:38:27,630 --> 00:38:30,010
♪ That never ends ♪

782
00:38:29,090 --> 00:38:30,620
Are you done making wishes?

783
00:38:30,690 --> 00:38:31,880
I suggest

784
00:38:32,070 --> 00:38:33,870
we take a group photo right here,

785
00:38:33,880 --> 00:38:35,510
leaving a spot for Shen,

786
00:38:35,510 --> 00:38:36,960
to mark our visit.

787
00:38:37,070 --> 00:38:37,820
-Okay.
-Okay!

788
00:38:37,820 --> 00:38:38,950
I'll get the camera.

789
00:38:39,840 --> 00:38:40,840
It's counting down. Hurry.

790
00:38:40,840 --> 00:38:42,670
Come on. 3, 2, 1.

791
00:39:00,830 --> 00:39:03,120
[Intercity Bus:
Xiaochongshan to Ougang]

792
00:39:15,820 --> 00:39:17,210
Get your luggage!

793
00:39:17,210 --> 00:39:19,000
Don't you want to learn skateboarding?

794
00:39:19,000 --> 00:39:20,330
I'll take you tomorrow.

795
00:39:20,670 --> 00:39:21,380
Sure.

796
00:39:22,730 --> 00:39:24,190
But I'm afraid of falling.

797
00:39:24,690 --> 00:39:26,280
I'll borrow protective gear for you,

798
00:39:26,280 --> 00:39:27,810
so it won't hurt if you fall.

799
00:39:29,400 --> 00:39:31,260
Come find me early tomorrow.

800
00:39:37,380 --> 00:39:38,640
Keep the emerald safe.

801
00:39:41,300 --> 00:39:42,760
Thank you for the emerald.

802
00:39:48,570 --> 00:39:52,610
[Ougang City
Public Security Bureau Summons]

803
00:39:57,960 --> 00:39:59,170
Your P2P lending

804
00:39:59,170 --> 00:40:00,050
has collapsed.

805
00:40:00,880 --> 00:40:02,860
The boss of the head office has run away.

806
00:40:02,860 --> 00:40:04,060
What about the money?

807
00:40:04,530 --> 00:40:05,460
They took it all.

808
00:40:06,230 --> 00:40:07,560
Over 2 billion in total.

809
00:40:08,460 --> 00:40:09,530
They took it all?

810
00:40:09,900 --> 00:40:10,610
Yes.

811
00:40:11,840 --> 00:40:13,440
Just the amount sold from you

812
00:40:13,860 --> 00:40:15,090
is over 2.2 million.

813
00:40:16,880 --> 00:40:19,710
2,276,500.

814
00:40:20,380 --> 00:40:22,840
You can't escape joint criminal liability.

815
00:40:24,320 --> 00:40:25,900
And your final sentence

816
00:40:26,780 --> 00:40:30,300
still depends on how cooperative you are
with our investigation.

817
00:40:30,300 --> 00:40:32,700
You must actively return all illegal gains

818
00:40:33,300 --> 00:40:34,500
and try your best

819
00:40:34,500 --> 00:40:36,760
to compensate all the clients
under your name for their losses.

820
00:40:36,760 --> 00:40:38,490
Try to earn their forgiveness.

821
00:40:59,820 --> 00:41:00,460
Hello?

822
00:41:02,690 --> 00:41:03,380
Hello?

823
00:41:04,030 --> 00:41:04,890
Say something.

824
00:41:05,480 --> 00:41:06,280
What's wrong?

825
00:41:07,780 --> 00:41:09,580
Did something happen to our son?

826
00:41:10,670 --> 00:41:11,050
No.

827
00:41:11,050 --> 00:41:12,170
Our son's fine.

828
00:41:12,170 --> 00:41:12,630
It's...

829
00:41:13,320 --> 00:41:14,730
I-It's me.

830
00:41:17,280 --> 00:41:17,980
I...

831
00:41:18,780 --> 00:41:20,840
I need to discuss something with you.

832
00:41:21,750 --> 00:41:23,440
What is it? Go on.

833
00:41:33,050 --> 00:41:33,780
Can...

834
00:41:35,670 --> 00:41:36,650
Can you...

835
00:41:38,760 --> 00:41:41,340
lend me two million?

836
00:41:43,430 --> 00:41:45,030
I was cheated by the company.

837
00:41:46,110 --> 00:41:47,110
The boss ran away.

838
00:41:52,690 --> 00:41:54,210
It's too much, right?

839
00:41:55,090 --> 00:41:56,230
Never mind. It's fine.

840
00:41:56,230 --> 00:41:56,900
Then...

841
00:41:57,550 --> 00:41:58,670
one million is also fine.

842
00:41:58,670 --> 00:41:59,730
Or even less.

843
00:42:00,400 --> 00:42:01,900
500... 500,000, okay?

844
00:42:01,940 --> 00:42:03,170
500,000 works too.

845
00:42:03,800 --> 00:42:04,800
Anything's fine.

846
00:42:06,840 --> 00:42:07,570
Guan Xunmei,

847
00:42:08,590 --> 00:42:10,250
I haven't had time to tell you,

848
00:42:10,500 --> 00:42:13,080
but all my money is
tied up in real estate.

849
00:42:13,340 --> 00:42:14,740
My company went bust too.

850
00:42:14,940 --> 00:42:16,270
I really can't help you.

851
00:42:17,590 --> 00:42:19,760
Do you need me to take our son?

852
00:42:20,360 --> 00:42:21,980
But in my current situation,

853
00:42:22,170 --> 00:42:24,100
it's really hard for me to take him.

854
00:42:37,900 --> 00:42:39,700
-Let's go home for dinner.
-Bye.

855
00:42:39,860 --> 00:42:40,980
-Bye-bye.
-Bye-bye.

856
00:42:40,980 --> 00:42:41,980
See you tomorrow.

857
00:42:42,090 --> 00:42:43,090
See you tomorrow.

858
00:42:43,440 --> 00:42:44,130
Bye-bye.

859
00:42:49,990 --> 00:42:52,870
[5 missed calls from Mom]

860
00:43:10,500 --> 00:43:11,300
Mom.

861
00:43:12,440 --> 00:43:13,780
Why are the lights off?

862
00:43:16,150 --> 00:43:17,210
I called you back later.

863
00:43:17,210 --> 00:43:18,470
Why didn't you answer?

864
00:43:21,690 --> 00:43:22,380
Mom?

865
00:43:29,280 --> 00:43:29,960
Mom!

866
00:44:04,110 --> 00:44:07,440
When I waved and told Jiang Yubai
I'd see him tomorrow,

867
00:44:08,780 --> 00:44:10,230
I thought I was just solving

868
00:44:10,230 --> 00:44:12,030
a math problem with clear steps.

869
00:44:12,630 --> 00:44:15,190
"See you tomorrow" was a constant.

870
00:44:16,710 --> 00:44:18,570
I'd see him like I always did.

871
00:44:19,400 --> 00:44:21,550
We'd do many things together.

872
00:44:21,920 --> 00:44:24,050
We'd see each other millions of times.

873
00:44:29,280 --> 00:44:31,140
But after I grew up, I learned that

874
00:44:32,050 --> 00:44:33,710
encounters between people

875
00:44:34,130 --> 00:44:35,590
aren't linear equations.

876
00:44:37,000 --> 00:44:39,780
There are no fixed slopes and intercepts.

877
00:44:40,690 --> 00:44:44,510
They're more like points scattered
at random, governed by probability.

878
00:44:44,510 --> 00:44:45,690
Every reunion

879
00:44:46,500 --> 00:44:48,590
takes a great deal of luck.

880
00:44:51,340 --> 00:44:54,610
And my luck seems to have run out.

881
00:44:56,460 --> 00:44:57,610
After that parting,

882
00:44:58,670 --> 00:45:00,510
my best friend, Jiang Yubai...

883
00:45:02,570 --> 00:45:04,840
disappeared from my world again.
